guide forever/class/druid/cure-poison
title Cure Poison
category Class
folder Druid
keywords Cure Poison, Lessons Anew, The Principal Source, Gathering the Cure, Curing the Sick, Power over Poison, Sickly Deer, Sickly Gazelle, Cliffspring Falls, Dreadmist Peak, Lunar Fungus, Earthroot, Kodo Horn, Mathrengyl Bearwalker, Hana Lighthoof, Skyborne, Moonglade, class quest
reward spell 8946 "Cure Poison"
reward item 15866
why Cure Poison is no longer trained in Forever: this chain teaches it, with a medicine bag on the way.
class Druid
levels 14-20
zone Moonglade

# Cure Poison: in Forever the spell is no longer trained, Power over Poison
# (6125 Alliance, 6130 Horde) rewards it (Forever's druid class quest list:
# "Rewards: adds Cure Poison").
# - Night Elves and Alliance Skyborne: Lessons Anew (6121: Mathrengyl
#   Bearwalker in Darnassus; Alfina Nightgaze west of Dalaran does not give
#   it, #978) -> Dendrite Starblaze in Moonglade -> The Principal
#   Source (6122: fill the sampler at Cliffspring Falls) -> Alanndarian
#   Nightsong in Auberdine: Gathering the Cure (6123: 5 Earthroot, 12 Lunar
#   Fungus) and Curing the Sick (6124: ten Sickly Deer) -> Dendrite -> Power
#   over Poison (6125) back to Mathrengyl.
# - Tauren and Horde Skyborne: Lessons Anew (6126: Turak Runetotem in Thunder
#   Bluff, or Hana Lighthoof in northern Mulgore by the Skyborne landing) ->
#   Dendrite -> The Principal Source (6127: Dreadmist Peak) -> Tonga
#   Runetotem at the Crossroads: Gathering the Cure (6128: 5 Earthroot, 5
#   Kodo Horns) and Curing the Sick (6129: ten Sickly Gazelles) -> Dendrite
#   -> Power over Poison (6130) back to Turak.
# Skyborne: quests.json opens 6121-6125 to Alliance Skyborne (a correction);
# the server race mask in the KB (EG) also opens 6126-6130 to Horde Skyborne
# (forever-db/corrections/quests.json, this branch).
# Earthroot needs Herbalism to pick (the quest text says so); vendors sell it
# (Forever's quest notes: Hula'mahi at the Crossroads, 80 copper each, three
# at a time until he restocks; Maria Lumere and Bernard Gump in Stormwind),
# else the Auction House.
# Gotchas from Forever's quest notes: the samplers call naga (Stormscale Wave
# Rider and Toxicologist, level 15) or three Burning Blade Toxicologists
# (level 13-14); the salve has ten doses and only works on living animals
# (abandon and retake for a new one); Entangling Roots then the salve counts
# twice when the roots kill the animal; the Lunar Fungal Blooms (20 spawns,
# 3 min) give one or two each.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie
# 12.1.0, Forever); Forever's quest data for quest 6123 (the Lunar Fungal
# Blooms grow in the moonkin caves east of Auberdine) and item 2449.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Night Elves and Alliance Skyborne
# Mathrengyl stands upstairs in the druids' building and the walking maps have no way up inside it:
# without a waypoint the arrow led round past the hunters' building onto a ledge outside his floor,
# behind the wall (#1338). Each step to him comes after a goto at the building's door on its south
# side, 35.8,11.6, where players' recordings walk in; from there the arrow points straight at him.

step Cenarion Enclave
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave. No Herbalism? Buy five Earthroot on the Auction House first: you need them later.
  level 14
  goto 35.8,11.6 "Cenarion Enclave"

step Lessons Anew
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave. No Herbalism? Buy five Earthroot on the Auction House first: you need them later.
  level 14
  accept 6121 npc 4217                  -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Cenarion Enclave
  only Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave; Alfina Nightgaze by the Skyborne Portal does not give this quest. Cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Herbalism? Buy five Earthroot on the Auction House first: you need them later.
  level 14
  goto 35.8,11.6 "Cenarion Enclave"

step Lessons Anew
  only Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands upstairs in the druids' building of the Cenarion Enclave; Alfina Nightgaze by the Skyborne Portal does not give this quest. Cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Herbalism? Buy five Earthroot on the Auction House first: you need them later.
  level 14
  accept 6121 npc 4217                  -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Dendrite Starblaze
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade: Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in the building beside you. He hands you the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler. Then fly to Auberdine (learn the Moonglade flight path at Sindrayl first if you have not).
  turnin 6121                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6122
  fly "Auberdine"

step Cliffspring Falls
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darkshore
  tip Head north-east from Auberdine to Cliffspring Falls. Stand at the cave mouth at the top of the waterfall, not in the river below, and use the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler (not the Empty Sampling Tube of another quest). Naga line the climb, a caster waits on the far bank, and filling the sampler calls two more (a Wave Rider and a Toxicologist, level 15): clear the way first and be ready to fight.
  use 15844 quest 6122.1 @54.9,33.3       -- Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler, at the cave mouth
  collect 15845 quest 6122.1            -- Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler

step Alanndarian Nightsong
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  tip Back in Auberdine, at the north end of the village.
  turnin 6122                           -- Alanndarian Nightsong
  accept 6123

step Lunar Fungus and Earthroot
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  tip The Lunar Fungal Blooms are tiny white-spotted mushrooms on the floors and walls of the small moonkin caves in the hills just east and south-east of Auberdine; each gives one or two fungus, and each cave holds only a few, so go from cave to cave (they regrow in three minutes). The moonkin there are irritable. No Herbalism needed for the blooms. Earthroot needs Herbalism: herbalists pick it all over Darkshore, anyone else buys it (Maria Lumere or Bernard Gump in Stormwind, or the Auction House).
  collect 15851 x12 quest 6123.2        -- Lunar Fungus
  collect 2449 x5 quest 6123.1          -- Earthroot

step Alanndarian Nightsong
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  tip She hands you the Curative Animal Salve: ten doses, one per deer. Destroy any leftover Lunar Fungus.
  turnin 6123                           -- Alanndarian Nightsong
  accept 6124

step Sickly Deer
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  tip Use the Curative Animal Salve on living Sickly Deer (level 5, a green cloud over them): they roam Darkshore from the Cliffspring River to the Ashenvale border, many around the Blackwood furbolg camp north-east of Auberdine. Druid trick: root a deer with Entangling Roots, apply the salve before the roots tick, and the root kill counts a second time. Lost a dose on a deer that did not count? Abandon the quest and take it again from Alanndarian for a fresh salve.
  kill 12298 quest 6124.1 "Use the Curative Animal Salve on Sickly Deer"

step Curing the Sick
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade and see Dendrite Starblaze, then take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed) and the portal up to Darnassus. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  turnin 6124                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6125
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Cenarion Enclave
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker, upstairs in the Cenarion Enclave, teaches you Cure Poison.
  goto 35.8,11.6 "Cenarion Enclave"

step Power over Poison
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker, upstairs in the Cenarion Enclave, teaches you Cure Poison.
  turnin 6125                           -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Cure Poison

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tauren and Horde Skyborne

step Lessons Anew
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Turak Runetotem stands in the druids' hut on Elder Rise; Hana Lighthoof, the Skyborne druid trainer where the airship from Zephras Isle lands in northern Mulgore, gives the same quest. No Herbalism? Hula'mahi at the Crossroads sells Earthroot later, or buy five on the Auction House now.
  level 14
  accept 6126                           -- Turak Runetotem, or Hana Lighthoof in northern Mulgore

step Dendrite Starblaze
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade: Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in the building beside you. He hands you the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler. Bunthen Plainswind flies druids to Thunder Bluff; fly on to the Crossroads from there.
  turnin 6126                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6127
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step Dreadmist Peak
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  zone The Barrens
  tip From the Crossroads head north to Dreadmist Peak and climb to the bubbling Dreadmist Peak Pool on its summit. Burning Blade cultists camp around it: pull them one or two at a time. Stand in the water and use the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler: three Burning Blade Toxicologists (level 13-14, curses and warlock spells) appear and attack. You need not kill them: once the sampler is full, run.
  fly "Crossroads"
  use 15842 quest 6127.1 @48.4,18.9       -- Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler, standing in the pool
  collect 15843 quest 6127.1            -- Filled Dreadmist Peak Sampler

step Tonga Runetotem
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  tip Tonga Runetotem stands in the Crossroads. No Herbalism? Hula'mahi, a few steps away by the wind rider master, sells Earthroot for 80 copper each, three at a time until he restocks.
  turnin 6127                           -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 6128
  buy 2449 x5 npc 3490 optional         -- Earthroot; herbalists pick it on the plains

step Earthroot and Kodo Horns
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  tip Every Lost Barrens Kodo (level 14-15) drops a horn, but they are few and wander: search the far north near the Sludge Fen and the oases, above all the Stagnant Oasis south-east of the Crossroads. They charge from range and stomp. Herbalists find Earthroot all over the northern Barrens.
  collect 15852 x5 quest 6128.2         -- Kodo Horn
  collect 2449 x5 quest 6128.1          -- Earthroot

step Tonga Runetotem
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  tip He hands you the Curative Animal Salve: ten doses, one per gazelle.
  turnin 6128                           -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 6129

step Sickly Gazelles
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  tip Use the Curative Animal Salve on living Sickly Gazelles (level 3): they graze on both sides of the road north of the Crossroads up to the Ashenvale border, north-west of the Crossroads and west of Ratchet. Druid trick: root a gazelle with Entangling Roots, apply the salve before the roots tick, and the root kill counts a second time, so five gazelles can do. Lost a dose? Abandon and retake the quest from Tonga for a fresh salve.
  kill 12296 quest 6129.1 "Use the Curative Animal Salve on Sickly Gazelles"

step Curing the Sick
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade and see Dendrite Starblaze, then take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  turnin 6129                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6130
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step Power over Poison
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise teaches you Cure Poison.
  turnin 6130                           -- Turak Runetotem: Cure Poison
